       "label": "Explanation",
       "number": 1,
       "quote": "Multiply numerator and denominator by x − 1",
       "stem": "$\\frac{1}{1-\\frac{1}{x-1}}$",
       "solution": [
        "$\\frac{1}{1-\\frac{1}{x-1}}=\\frac{1\\times(x-1)}{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{x-1}\\right)\\times(x-1)}$",
        "$=\\frac{x-1}{(x-1)-\\frac{x-1}{x-1}}$",
        "$=\\frac{x-1}{(x-1)-1}$",
        "$=\\frac{x-1}{x-2}$"
       ],
       "answer": "$\\frac{x-1}{x-2}$",
       "notes": "Side note: 'Multiply numerator and denominator by x − 1'. Third line has cancellation strokes drawn on (x-1)/(x-1); read from image, verify.",
