       "label": "Explanation",
       "number": 2,
       "quote": "Multiply numerator and denominator by (1 − x)(1 + x)",
       "stem": "$\\frac{\\frac{1}{1-x}+\\frac{1}{1+x}}{\\frac{1}{1-x}-\\frac{1}{1+x}}$",
       "solution": [
        "$=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}+\\frac{1}{1+x}\\right)\\times(1-x)(1+x)}{\\left(\\frac{1}{1-x}-\\frac{1}{1+x}\\right)\\times(1-x)(1+x)}$",
        "$=\\frac{\\frac{(1-x)(1+x)}{1-x}+\\frac{(1-x)(1+x)}{1+x}}{\\frac{(1-x)(1+x)}{1-x}-\\frac{(1-x)(1+x)}{1+x}}$ (common factors crossed out)",
        "$=\\frac{(1+x)+(1-x)}{(1+x)-(1-x)}$",
        "$=\\frac{2}{2x}$",
        "$=\\frac{1}{x}$"
       ],
       "answer": "$\\frac{1}{x}$",
       "notes": "Side note: 'Multiply numerator and denominator by (1 − x)(1 + x)'.",
